GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4783980,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4783980-1847286114037007","game_id":"steam-4783980","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.4.4","summary":"V0.4.4Reworked how drifting feelsGave some UI components more loveTweaked how burn, toxin and bleed work to balance them more fairlyFixed lots of bugs. Lots of multiplayer bugs in particular.Greed rune now scales exponentially per scrap earnedYou can now surrender endless modeSnowball overlaps better visually","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:04:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037007","verified_at":"2026-10-23T19:25:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4783980-1846651706692092","game_id":"steam-4783980","kind":"announcement","title":"Endless mode is here!","summary":"Ahoy Captains,It's the Steam Next Fest and with it we are dropping more content for the demo! We expect this will be the final major update for the demo ahead of the main game launch but fear not there's plenty to enjoy.What's new?Endless mode is here. After successfully completing a run you can now continue on into endless mode. Endless mode is exponentially more difficult than the regular voyage so get ready for some up hill battles as you push your build to the limit.A new weapon has arrived.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:14:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692092","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4783980-1846651706674188","game_id":"steam-4783980","kind":"update","title":"GUNBOAT-8: New item update!","summary":"Ahoy, Captains!V0.3.0 is here, with 20+ new items and runes and balance changes across the board.NewBaked Goods (item)Broken Staff (item)Hooks (item)Cannonball (item)Cold Brew (item)Zap (item)Ice Bath (item)Ember (item)Tunnel Vision (item)Venom (item)Wonky Graph (item)Kindling (item)Rusty Dagger (item)Spoils (item)Sin (item)Joker (rune)Enchanted (rune)Stone (rune)Relic (rune)Extra Blasters (skill)BalancesStatus cards now update to reflect modifiersBosses are now staggered by 3 seconds to give so","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:46:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674188","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4783980-1846018067940723","game_id":"steam-4783980","kind":"update","title":"BIG Balance Patch","summary":"Ahoy Captains,More balances incoming. Keep blastin'.BalancesMerging two weapons now grants 1 scrapNew difficultyBomber damage 8 -> 7Bomber hp 2 -> 1.8Sea Legs 1hp/s -> 1.5hp/sReduced enemy damage scaling by 10%Sniper HP 14 -> 10Artillery HP 52 -> 42Heavy HP 68 -> 60Breacher HP 70 -> 56Hauler HP 90 -> 70Swarmer damage 5 -> 4Scout damage 3 -> 2Submerger damage 5 -> 4Rammer damage (detonation) 5 -> 4Charger damage 12 -> 8Sniper damage 25 -> 15Artillery damage 20 -> 15Heavy damage 4 -> 5 (buffed lol","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T12:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940723","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4783980-1846018067938337","game_id":"steam-4783980","kind":"update","title":"v0.2.1 patch notes","summary":"Ahoy Captains,Today we're releasing a minor patch to the demo.NewThe game arena is now 16:9 instead of 16:10. This should feel more natural to many players as 16:9 is a more common resolution.The game screen no longer scales by half resolutions, giving a cleaner, crisper image.Added more default resolutionsMinor changes to the game boarder to account for the new resolutions tweaksBalancesBomber damage reduced from 10 to 8Cannon cooldown reduced to 1.25sCrow's nest now provided additional HP per ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T11:48:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938337","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4783980-1846018067925506","game_id":"steam-4783980","kind":"update","title":"First major update!","summary":"Ahoy captains,Exciting news! We have just released the first major update for the game. Thank you for everyone who has picked up the game and given it a go. If you haven't yet, make sure to leave a review on Steam, it really helps small teams like us.UpdatesNew random events in runs. Random events put your skills to the test, but yield legendary rewards! Look out for these new suspicious areas on the map, and challenge if you dare.Escort: escort a merchant vessel as it makes it's way through unc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T09:27:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925506","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4783980-1845383656377077","game_id":"steam-4783980","kind":"announcement","title":"GUNBOAT-8 | demo out now!","summary":"Ahoy Captains,Exciting news, the GUNBOAT-8 demo is officially here to play! Be sure to get your hands on the demo to checkout the game. We will be adding new content to the demo over the next few weeks, to stay tuned and check back for updates.Features:Unlock 7 ships to play through your voyages with. GUNBOAT-8 focuses on deep meta-progression, making every run feel unique and fresh.Play as 3 captains. All captains come with unique skills which you can unlock as you play and level up your captai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T10:33:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377077","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4783980-1835236783566674","game_id":"steam-4783980","kind":"announcement","title":"Ready your sails, captains","summary":"Ahoy captains,Coming straight off the back of our previous project, Holding Pattern, we're transitioning from inter-galactic conquests to naval warfare with our studios newest title, GUNBOAT-8GUNBOAT-8 is inspired by popular bullet heaven games such as Brotato and SNKRX but we hope to inject our own taste into the genre to keep things fresh and exciting. We are shortly releasing a free public playtest over on itch, so if you're keen to get your hands on the game early be sure to keep an eye open","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-13T20:52:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783566674","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4783980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:23:33Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:23:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4783980":"2026-10-26T04:23:33Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4783980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:23:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:23:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5